# -----------------------------------------------
# AI PM Workflow — .gitignore
# -----------------------------------------------
# The framework files (agents/, orchestrator.md, CLAUDE.md, instructions.md)
# are tracked and should be committed — that's what you forked this for.
#
# Your actual project work is personal. The rules below keep it local.
# -----------------------------------------------

# All real project folders (anything under projects/ except the template)
projects/*/
!projects/.template/
!projects/.template/**

# Portfolio artifacts — your specific backlog and deck are personal
portfolio/stakeholder-deck.pptx
portfolio/portfolio-backlog.md

# Memory files — these are personal to your working style and decisions
memory/*.md
!memory/MEMORY.md

# Reference materials you drop in — likely contain proprietary content
reference/*
!reference/README.md

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
